{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. This limit is set by the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and applies until further notice.[[cite:obs-3afce953e4a41020627be9af58a82190db3dd99c \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nWhere the CFO directive and the procurement policy differ, the CFO directive applies.[[cite:obs-3afce953e4a41020627be9af58a82190db3dd99c \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"dfcd763969c2dff53db1f49da20236702c93f56d2fce3f52f57fd9b81571357a","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Removed mention of the procurement policy's 2000 EUR limit to comply with the requirement that only the CFO directive's single-signature purchase limit (1000 EUR) is stated, with citations from the CFO directive only."}